  m_text: 'Welcome to  Emely''s and Anna''s ''Sweet Home''!

    Your goal is to
    explore the environment, interact with some objects, and read their story.

    Use
    the ''Next'' and ''Previous'' buttons on the screen to navigate through different
    rooms.

    Use arrow keys or ''WASD'' keys to rotate camera to see around a
    room.

    The camera will transition smoothly between rooms.'
